  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "White Knuckle",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/23159/450x258/white-knuckle-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1789034400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/23159-buy-white-knuckle-pc-steam/",
      "user": "ZoeClaw",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/30567455-1771058032.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Love this game. \n\n\n\nAt first it's very hard but when you learn how to manage your stamina and items and other items in game, it becomes relatively easy. I still die quite frequently even tho I already have like 100 hours in it, but it's still very fun game. It also keeps evolving in a sense with your experience. With how far you get it one run, the next run will be harder because the game adapts to your level of skills. And the more skilled you are the more challenging the game gets.\n\n\n\nVery good game."
    },
    {
      "game": "Echoes of the End",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/19795/450x258/echoes-of-the-end-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1789034400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/19795-buy-echoes-of-the-end-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Katalyzt",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "I tried it when the Enhanced version came out. This is an extremely mediocre experience. I won't get into details here since now reads these, but in short: it's a very mid game, with basic animations, terrible balance and an incredibly unlikeable main character and a really cool side character that just gets berated by the main one. Combat is ok at best, story is boring and everything you play you will forget 1h max after playing. Don't bother."
    },
    {
      "game": "ReStory: Chill Electronics Repairs",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/23124/450x258/restory-chill-electronics-repairs-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1789034400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/23124-buy-restory-chill-electronics-repairs-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Katalyzt",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Very fun chill game. For the price it's a bit short on content, but it's ok. The story is much shorter than the amount of devices you can buy.\n\n\n\nRepairing all these old devices brings back nostalgia like you wouldn't believe. \n\n\n\nSo if you wanna play a game that lets you listen to a podcast during it, this is a great choice."
    },
    {
      "game": "Star Wars Zero Company Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/23813/450x258/star-wars-zero-company-deluxe-edition-pc-ea-app-cover.jpg?v=1789034400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/23813-buy-star-wars-zero-company-deluxe-edition-pc-ea-app/",
      "user": "Katalyzt",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "I was shocked, but this is a VERY good game. \n\n\n\nSadly it has the usual performace of an UE5 game, as in garbage, but other than that and a few glitches this is a very competent game (also this is a turned based game so performance is not as important lets be honest). The characters are REALLY funny and momorable, and the gameplay is solid, very similar to XCOM games.\n\n\n\nThe game has a timer mechanic (similar to Blood of the dawnwalker), but with mods anything you want can be changed to your liking. For example my favorite mod was one that allowed me to bring 6 characters instead of the usual 4.\n\n\n\nGraphics are amazing, and the star wars sounds and lore is very well done. Also the best period in star wars, the clone wars is where this takes place. \n\n\n\nHighly recommended."
    }
  ],
